// Primary effect only: a passive self-ward while the caster concentrates. The
// source spell's secondary action -- touching a creature to end a charm/possession
// on it, or to force a banish check on a summoned creature -- is not implemented
// here; this ability has no per-target trigger for either of those. There is also
// no creature-kind-conditional resistance primitive in this engine, so the ward
// reduces all incoming damage while it holds rather than only damage from
// Celestial/Elemental/Fey/Fiend/Undead attackers (see BuffKind::OtherworldlyWard).
SelfBuff(
    buildup_duration: 0.5,
    cast_duration: 0.2,
    recover_duration: 0.35,
    buffs: [
        BuffDesc(kind: OtherworldlyWard, data: BuffData(strength: 0.3, duration: Some(60.0))),
    ],
    energy_cost: 90.0,
    meta: (school: Some(Abjuration), source: Some(Divine)),
)
